@startuml
!include ../../../images/common-sequence.iuml

title HW-Reg — Identity Provisioning

actor "Operator" as Op

box "HW-Reg Device (ESP8266)" $OnPrem
    participant "HW-Reg\nFirmware" as HWReg
    database "EEPROM" as EEPROM
end box

Op -> HWReg : **Connect to WiFi**\n""FireFly-{MAC}""

Op -> HWReg : **GET /api/identity**
HWReg --> Op : **HTTP 404**\n""{ "error": "not provisioned" }""

Op -> HWReg : **POST /api/identity**\n""{ uuid, product_id, product_hex }""
HWReg -> HWReg : **Generate 32-byte master key**\n""os_get_random()""
HWReg -> EEPROM : **Write 87-byte identity block**
EEPROM --> HWReg : OK
HWReg --> Op : **HTTP 201 Created**\n""{ "status": "ok" }""

Op -> HWReg : **GET /api/identity**
HWReg --> Op : **HTTP 200**\n""{ uuid, product_id, product_hex }""

@enduml
